All tests pass. Here's what I implemented:

**`transpose.py`** — A `transpose(text)` function that:
1. Splits input text into lines
2. Pads shorter lines with spaces on the right (to handle jagged input)
3. Transposes by reading columns left-to-right, building each output row
4. Strips trailing spaces from each output row (no right-padding in output)

